ReadIniDof.doc:
Read DOF file.
If record = 0 read DATBOX/DOF.INI file,
if record > 0 read OUTBOX/DOF.OUT.record file,
if record < 0 read OUTBOX/DOF.LAST file,
and next written will be OUTBOX/DOF.OUT.record.
Must be called after LoadBehaviours.

